OL,3,GNEWSADocumentary tells story of city's
OL,4,AMuslim community
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Gloucester filmmaker has made a
OL,7,Fdocumentary that details the history
OL,8,Fand experiences of the city's Muslim
OL,9,Fpopulation.
OL,11,FMohamed Husain Jaffer, who has lived in
OL,12,FGloucester since 1977, spent months
OL,13,Fplanning, filming and editing a new
OL,14,Fdocumentary called Eid in Gloucester
OL,15,Fwith the intention of not only
OL,16,Fcapturing the atmosphere of Eid, but
OL,17,Falso the stories, history and
OL,18,Fexperiences of Muslims who have made
OL,19,FGloucester their home.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
