OL,3,GNEWSADocumentary tells story of city's
OL,4,AMuslim community
OL,5,
OL,6,FJaffer said he wanted to capture how
OL,7,Fthe community had grown since he
OL,8,Farrived in the city.
OL,10,FHe says that "although Gloucester is
OL,11,Fsmall, it has a big heart as many
OL,12,Fcommunities fit in it".
